# Mic Buddy (Powered by TrackBarz) - Project Rules

## Stack
- Next.js 14 App Router, TypeScript strict mode
- Prisma + Postgres, Clerk auth
- Tailwind + shadcn/ui components
- Zod for validation, React Hook Form for forms

## Critical Conventions
- NEVER use setInterval or Date.now() for audio timing
- ALWAYS use audioContext.currentTime + requestAnimationFrame for audio-synced UI
- API routes return { error: { code, message, details? } } on failure
- All API inputs validated with Zod schemas from /shared
- Prisma User row is upserted by Clerk userId on first authenticated request

## File Structure
- /app = Next.js pages + route handlers
- /components = shared UI (shadcn-based)
- /lib = db client, auth helpers, utils
- /lib/audio = all Web Audio API code (Day 3+)
- /prisma = schema, migrations, seed
- /shared = Zod schemas, shared types

## Never
- Commit .env or secrets
- Write tests unless asked (Day 1-10 is MVP sprint, not TDD)
- Add dependencies without checking if already installed
